{"words": [{"text": "كَدَأْبِ", "translation": "Like behavior"}, {"text": "ءَالِ", "translation": "(of the) people"}, {"text": "فِرْعَوْنَ", "translation": "(of) Firaun"}, {"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "and those who"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "(were) from"}, {"text": "قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "before them"}, {"text": "كَذَّبُوا۟", "translation": "They denied"}, {"text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا", "translation": "Our Signs"}, {"text": "فَأَخَذَهُمُ", "translation": "so seized them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بِذُنُوبِهِمْ ۗ", "translation": "for their sins"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "شَدِيدُ", "translation": "(is) severe"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِقَابِ", "translation": "(in) [the] punishment"}], "sahih": "[Theirs is] like the custom of the people of Pharaoh and those before them. They denied Our signs, so Allāh seized them for their sins. And Allāh is severe in penalty."}